<p class="mt-2">Retention by each Model Provider follows its own terms. OpenAI requests from Tangle sandboxes are sent with <code>store: false</code>, and Anthropic processing is covered by a Zero Data Retention addendum. The applicable customer agreement governs provider selection and notice requirements. This inventory does not by itself establish that any required customer notice or vendor assessment has been completed.</p>
        </div>
